description:
****Performs the technical activities of his discipline in accordance with the project development plan:****
* Analyze project requirements based on specifications ;
* Perform technical activities in compliance with R\&D methodologies and standards ;
* Follow\-up activities in line with Quality, Cost and Deadline objectives ;
* Provide the necessary technical information to the various stakeholders in the project (project teams, suppliers, etc.).
* Propose solutions to technical problems encountered ;
* Respect intellectual property requirements in line with project team instructions ;


**Accountable For**
* Respect and ensure the respect for all environmental, energy and health and safety risk prevention standards, and to alert in case of deviation ;
* Comply with current policies and procedures ;
* Participate in the continuous improvement process within the team ;
* Respect product compliance rules.

**Have a Significant Competency In His Domain**
* Contribute to the technical knowledge of the organization by capitalizing best practices;
* Ensure standard excellence. Continuously improve standards;
* Contribute on transversal initiatives;
* Support the team leader in tailoring the standard processes based on project needs.


****Design complex features and/or support/provide solutions to operational entities and control technical choices made:****
* Support during competition Phase (RFQ), in the choice of technical solutions for mature products;
* Develop Discipline requirements by gathering the project different stakeholders’ requirements for mature products, consolidating them and identifying any conflicting requirements;
* Design complex features;
* Perform technical reviews on the different project’s activities;
* Present work progress continuously through active participation on project meetings;
* Develop a features list and organize them into work packages delivery phases to ensure maximum value delivered to the customer with each phase (optimize, reuse);
* Support Design Leaders \& Project Management in the Discipline development planning;
* Check the performance level of the technical solutions provided.


**Can Provide Innovative Technologies Solutions**
* Contribute for system and customer requirements analysis for new products;
* Contribute for high level design architecture definition for new products;


**Coach In His Domain**
* Coach standard technical reviewers in his domain
